    "content": "{% extends \"base.html\" %}\n{% block title %}{{ 'Edit' if item else 'Add' }} transaction{% endblock %}\n{% block breadcrumb %}Transactions / {{ 'Edit' if item else 'Add new' }}{% endblock %}\n{% block content %}\n<div class=\"page-heading\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">KEEP IT UP TO DATE</div><h1>{{ 'Edit transaction' if item else 'Add a transaction' }}</h1><p>Capture the details now. Future you will be glad you did.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-page-grid\"><section class=\"panel form-panel\"><form method=\"post\" class=\"form-stack transaction-form\">\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf_token\" value=\"{{ csrf_token() }}\">\n  <div class=\"field-label\">Transaction type</div><div class=\"segmented\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"kind\" value=\"expense\" {{ 'checked' if not item or item.kind == 'expense' }}><span>↘ Expense</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"kind\" value=\"income\" {{ 'checked' if item and item.kind == 'income' }}><span>↗ Income</span></label></div>\n  <label>Amount (₹)<div class=\"amount-input\"><span>₹</span><input type=\"number\" name=\"amount\" min=\"0.01\" max=\"99999999.99\" step=\"0.01\" placeholder=\"0.00\" value=\"{{ item.amount if item else '' }}\" required></div></label>\n  <label>Category<select name=\"category_id\" id=\"categorySelect\" required><option value=\"\">Choose a category</option>{% for c in categories %}<option value=\"{{ c.id }}\" data-kind=\"{{ c.kind }}\" {{ 'selected' if item and item.category_id == c.id }}>{{ c.name }}</option>{% endfor %}</select></label>\n  <label>Date<input type=\"date\" name=\"transaction_date\" value=\"{{ item.transaction_date.isoformat() if item else today.isoformat() }}\" required></label>\n  <label>Payment method<select name=\"payment_method\">{% for p in ['UPI','Cash','Card','Bank transfer','Other'] %}<option {{ 'selected' if item and item.payment_method == p }}>{{ p }}</option>{% endfor %}</select></label>\n  <label>Description <span class=\"optional\">(optional)</span><input name=\"description\" maxlength=\"255\" placeholder=\"e.g. Lunch with friends\" value=\"{{ item.description if item else '' }}\"></label>\n  <div class=\"form-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"{{ url_for('transactions') }}\">Cancel</a><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">{{ 'Save changes' if item else 'Save transaction' }} <span>→</span></button></div>\n</form></section><aside class=\"form-tip\"><div class=\"tip-icon\">✦</div><h3>A little awareness goes a long way.</h3><p>Tracking even the small things can reveal patterns that help you save for what matters.</p><div class=\"tip-divider\"></div><div class=\"tip-point\"><span>01</span><div><strong>Be consistent</strong><p>Add transactions as they happen.</p></div></div><div class=\"tip-point\"><span>02</span><div><strong>Choose a category</strong><p>Make your spending insights more useful.</p></div></div></aside></div>\n{% endblock %}\n"
